  "name": "neural-assemblies",
  "description": "This repository implements the Assembly Calculus and NEMO models to simulate brain computation through synchronized groups of neurons representing cognitive concepts. It facilitates the study of complex neural operations such as projection, association, and merge for modeling language acquisition, syntactic parsing, and Turing-equivalent computational power. The framework provides both high-level Python simulations for cognitive experiments and optimized C++ implementations for large-scale neural network dynamics.",
